## Input

```css
.a {
  @extend %base @debug "x";
  width: 1px;
}
.b {
  @import "theme.css" screen @warn "x";
  width: 1px;
}
.empty {
  @import;
  @debug "empty";
  width: 1px;
}
.trailing {
  @import "one.css",;
  @warn "trailing";
  width: 1px;
}
.after { height: 2px; }

